OL,3,AFirst day of Ukraine peace talks 'very
OL,4,Aproductive', US says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first day of trilateral talks
OL,7,Fbetween Ukraine, Russia and the US
OL,8,Faimed at ending the war in Ukraine has
OL,9,Fconcluded in Abu Dhabi.
OL,11,FWhile senior officials from Kyiv and
OL,12,FMoscow were tight-lipped after the four
OL,13,Fhour-long discussions - due to resume
OL,14,Fon Wednesday - US Secretary of State
OL,15,FMarco Rubio, who did not attend the
OL,16,Ftalks, said they had been "very
OL,17,Fproductive".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
